{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/175787-2-sentence-tell-a-story","id":175787,"title":"2 Sentence Tell a Story","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-20T22:33:18-07:00","id":175787,"title":"2 Sentence Tell a Story","content":"Admittedly, I am copying this from another forum that is having fantastic results with this. The goal is to create a Werewolf themed story in 2 sentence intervals.<br /> <br /> Rule #1 Additions may only be 2 sentences in length<br /> Rule #2 No poster may post twice in a row<br /> Rule #3 The Pure or Balehounds are the main POV<br /> Rule #4 Forsaken are allowed as a POV, yet only in regards of driving the plot forward<br /> Rule #5 Run-on sentences shall be frowned upon<br /> <br /> <b>STORY START </b><br /> <br /> The music was loud, loud in a way that showed that all this club cared about was sacrificing quality for sheer decibels. However, this was not a night for dancing no matter how many men gave her that questioning look.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":444,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","user":"Dessembrae","date":". 06-21-2014, 01:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T22:59:46-07:00","id":175802,"title":"","content":"&quot;This club is loud, loud in a way that shows that all this club cares about is sacrificing quality for sheer decibels,&quot; said one of the men to the woman. &quot;Agreed,&quot; she said, primping her hair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T16:54:53-07:00","id":180169,"title":"","content":"&quot;She pulls the Altoids tin out of her purse and pops it open just as the first customers arrive. Hey... girls gotta make a livin', and the MDMA helps keep the humans occupied just in case something goes down.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1824,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","user":"Xaielao","date":". 07-06-2014, 09:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","name":"Xaielao","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T20:30:57-07:00","id":182492,"title":"","content":"Watching the pulsing mass of the club-goers, throbbing in time to the beat that shook the sternum as well as the floor, her eyes picked out vestiges of faces, limbs, and clothes. Her customers disgorge from the mass and are reabsorbed, ecstatic and satiated, as she searches earnestly for the face of the one who lured her here tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T21:30:10-07:00","id":188487,"title":"","content":"John Dull's pale, puffy face threads through the hoi polloi, as remorseless as it is forgettable. Marked revellers murmur &quot;I hate music,&quot; as they shamble past our protagonist, whose name is Yvonne Kress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T18:32:06-07:00","id":189756,"title":"","content":"In what would be an impossibility for anyone but a member of the Tzuumfin, Yvonne scented the one which had brought her all the way here. A lone female, perhaps 20 years of age if being generous, and seemingly oblivious to the impact she was having on the surrounding area as she grinded her way from one partner to the next.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T13:12:32-07:00","id":195701,"title":"","content":"The boy shivered as he heard the cacophony of clawed paws skittering across the floor under his bed. <i>Not again</i> he thought as the scent then did hit him- the scent of rotten meat that made him gag and caused a primal shudder of revulsion run through him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}